{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：10:47 2026-10-30 HKT<br/>發佈時間：10:47 2026-10-30 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：10:47 2026-10-30 HKT</p><p>西貢清水灣大坳門道往將軍澳方向，今（30日）早上10時23分，一名男子駕駛私家車，報稱避狗扭右失控，鏟上行人路後翻側，司機一度被困車內，消防到場將他救出，幸他僅受輕傷，清醒送院治理。警方正調查意外原因。</p><img alt=\"反車私家車司機清醒送院。楊偉亨攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4daad4356ae6177cea13ebad21f67a98/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_31_10.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警員到場調查。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4ed3d5ea18b6e485ea963ac59122937a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_37_1_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"私家車鏟上行人路翻側。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/b4d2f74866e34633b45773c693a4bddf/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_36_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/f9f10e2d7b914b26fe3d0961a4d5ace2/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_36.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/549ab904e25fdb00c393efb53fdd233a/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_35_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0c195ba0212ab8a94990a85d5dcd4719/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_35.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"司機輕傷送院。劉漢權攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/996ac1d6e6d6c3585ae3288b10a10d77/2026-10/WhatsApp_Image_2026-10-30_at_11_14_38_0.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T05:27:02.765527+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":7,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T02:47:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T06:20:39.139125+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T05:21:05.680082+00:00","content_hash":"10167eb36b83c7aeabde1c64221673dd265f8bf71f771daaa8c3655b51e301aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}